# FMEA FAILURE MODES WITH TYPED RATINGS
#
# Closes FLAG-04. Every rating below was already in this file as free text in a
# component or deviation description; it is now queryable. Ratings are Danaos
# FMEA worksheet values for vessel V145 (severity, occurrence, detection, and
# the risk priority number as recorded), not values computed by the graph.
